senses.gloss:
विहंगम + .{@-मः@}
—1 A bird; (गृहदीर्घिकाः) मदकलोदकलोलविहंगमाः R. 9. 37;
 Ms. 1. 39; H. 1. 34.
—2 The sun; तथेत्युक्त्वा तु तां कुन्तीमाविवेश विहंगमः Mb. 3. 307. 23.

विहृत + .{@-तम्@}
—1 One of the ten modes of indicating love used by women; see S. D. 125, 146;
 (written विकृत also in this sense).
—2 Sport, play; Dk. 2. 6.
—3 A walk.
—4 Hesitation.
